<title>THAILAND: KR Precision ups foreign shareholder limit.</title>
<headline>KR Precision ups foreign shareholder limit.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai hard disk drive suspension manufacturer KR Precision Plc said on Friday it had received permission from the Commerce Ministry to raise its foreign shareholding limit to 90 percent from 49 percent.</p>
<p>The firm's registered capital was 279.3 million baht ($10.7 million) split into to 27.93 million shares with a par value of 10 baht per share, the firm said in a statement to the Stock Exchange of Thailand. ($1 = 26 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
